WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
I haven’t had any guests in two years

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:04,720
I received more than 400 chicken points in one morning.

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,280
Good morning, gentlemen

4
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:12,200
How did you sleep last night? Good morning

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,720
The boss slept well but couldn't get in the car.

6
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:21,780
I want to ask the boss if there are any lunch boxes?

7
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:24,300
Can the lunch boxes in the store be packed and taken away?

8
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,740
But I can only take fifteen copies

9
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,340
And each portion will be charged an additional five chicken cents.

10
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,860
My family at the base can also eat it.

11
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,780
Whether to use a second-level gold box

12
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:32,940
Redeem 500 chicken points

13
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,240
Zhenran leg rice

14
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:38,250
I eat it deliciously

15
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:39,450
Fish-flavored shredded pork rice

16
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,100
Hot and sour potato shreds

17
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:43,980
I ate too much

18
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,060
Fresh meat xiaolongbao

19
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:48,960
Then just have three servings

20
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:52,780
There are also fifteen breakfasts to take away together to congratulate the host.

21
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,300
Received 333 chicken points

22
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,900
Of which 150 chicken points are the handling fee

23
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,180
Yidao host private account

24
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:00,520
My hotel has been upgraded to level 2

25
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,920
Hotel increases number of rooms

26
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:12,280
Let's leave with Mr. Xia who opened the breakfast room.

27
00:01:12,870 --> 00:01:15,300
Welcome to Huigu next time, rest assured

28
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:16,820
We will definitely come again
